cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the catalog, the lenses or this code, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "neuron-lens: a catalog of every MLP neuron and attention head of Qwen3-8B and Gemma 4 12B"
authors:
  - name: "@_a9lim"
    website: "https://x.com/_a9lim"
  - name: "@treetowntree"
    website: "https://x.com/treetowntree"
  - name: "Claude"
    website: "https://www.anthropic.com/claude"
abstract: >-
  Reads every MLP neuron (both poles) and every attention head of Qwen3-8B and Gemma 4 12B three
  ways: from their weights alone, through two Jacobian lenses (the R-lens and the S-lens); from
  their activations over 15M tokens of text; and from the exact tokens that drive them. Gemma 4's
  neurons are also read through images and sound. The release holds the catalog, the lenses, and
  measurements of where each way of reading works and where it fails.
url: "https://neuron-lens.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/stdlogits/neuron-lens"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - mechanistic interpretability
  - neurons
  - attention heads
  - Jacobian lens
  - Qwen3-8B
  - Gemma 4
